==Description==
The '''Showstopper Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 26 of the premium [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|860}} or {{Robux|82}} ({{Robux|75}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|10,255}} or {{Robux|2,477}} ({{Robux|1,971}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

The '''Showstopper Nametag''' has translucent white text and orange to yellow gradient outline. It also emits red smoke, has red and yellow sparkes appear around it and causes playing cards to fall out of the text.

